{"schema_version":2,"stage":"private_preparation","status":"prepared_without_translation_judgment","current_pair":"宇文逸↔莫問","scene_groups":["5805_3","5805_4","5807_1"],"source":{"target":"CG表","namespace":"QuestDlgs"},"source_artifact":{"workflow":"Release train orchestrator","run_id":30213262353,"artifact_id":8635079552,"artifact_name":"curated-fixes-qa-21","artifact_file":"relation_audit/yuwen_mowen.json","digest":"sha256:3ee23cff26556950fa23b68a69c1f334b85d90b696395a8051834c6c062b0760","head_sha":"84f877624827b782342a054b85b76806a3bd4926"},"scene_context":{"before":[],"after":[],"timeline":"蒼淹を取り逃がした直後、宇文逸と莫問が負傷と逃走方向から一線天峡谷を追う。","branch_note":"宇文逸の悔しさへ原文にない能力獲得を足さず、莫問の逃走先推測を確定事実へしない。"},"rows":[{"key":"5805_3_Dlgs_Index0_Text","speaker":"宇文逸","zh":"太可惜了，只差一点就抓到他了……没想到他的轻功这么好！","ja":"くっ……あと一歩だったのに。あれほどの軽功まで身につけていたとは！"},{"key":"5805_3_Dlgs_Index1_Text","speaker":"莫问","zh":"师弟……","ja":"師弟……"},{"key":"5805_4_Dlgs_Index0_Text","speaker":"莫问","zh":"此人受了伤应该跑不远，很可能就近躲藏。","ja":"奴は手傷を負っている。遠くへは行けない。近くに潜んでいるはずだ。"},{"key":"5805_4_Dlgs_Index1_Text","speaker":"莫问","zh":"看他刚才离开的方向，应该是往西边的一线天峡谷去了……我们先出城，然后过去那边找找看吧。","ja":"逃げた方角からすれば、西の一線天峡谷だろう……いったん城を出て、あちらを捜すぞ。"},{"key":"5805_4_Dlgs_Index2_Text","speaker":"宇文逸","zh":"好，就按师兄说的办！","ja":"分かりました。師兄の読みを信じます！"},{"key":"5807_1_Dlgs_Index0_Text","speaker":"宇文逸","zh":"是苍鹰！","ja":"蒼鷹だ！"},{"key":"5807_1_Dlgs_Index1_Text","speaker":"莫问","zh":"他去了峡谷深处，我们追！","ja":"峡谷の奥へ入った。追うぞ！"},{"key":"5807_1_Dlgs_Index2_Text","speaker":"宇文逸","zh":"好！","ja":"分かりました！"}],"ownership_snapshot":{"schema_version":1,"generated_from":"all_fixes_glob","fix_glob":"_phase4_proofread/fixes_*.json","target":"CG表","namespace":"QuestDlgs","row_count":8,"existing":[{"path":"_phase4_proofread/fixes_relation_yuwen_mowen_20260723_batch13.json","keys":["5805_3_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5805_4_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5805_4_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5805_4_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5807_1_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5807_1_Dlgs_Index1_Text"]},{"path":"_phase4_proofread/fixes_relation_yuwen_mowen_20260727_batch15.json","keys":["5807_1_Dlgs_Index2_Text"]}],"unowned":["5805_3_Dlgs_Index1_Text"],"duplicates":[]},"candidate_questions":["宇文逸の悔しさが原文にない軽功習得の説明へ変わっていないか","莫問の推測と宇文逸の応答に原文以上の断定や信頼説明を足していないか","追跡中の短い応答を説明的な長文へ広げていないか"],"unresolved_gates":{"allusion_candidates":[],"fact_doubts":["蒼鷹が一線天峡谷へ向かったことは、この時点では莫問の推測として扱う"]},"forbidden_outputs":["fix_or_keep_decision","fix_json_write","new_owner_assignment","formal_bundle_completion","throughput_metrics"]}
